      en: ["Seat of the Indénié Kingdom (Agni people)", "Capital of the Indénié-Djuablin Region", "Home to the historic Royal Palace", "Significant center for cocoa and coffee trade", "Founded by Akan refugees from modern-day Ghana", "Name means 'I do not like long speeches'", "Major cultural center for Agni traditions", "Located near the border with Ghana"]
