    facts: {
      de: ["Die westlichste Stadt an der ivorischen Küste.", "Wichtiger städtischer Knotenpunkt."],
      hu: ["Az elefántcsontparti partvidék legnyugatibb városa.", "Fontos városi csomópont."],
      ro: ["Cel mai vestic oraș de pe coasta ivoriană.", "Nod urban important."],
      en: ["The westernmost city on the Ivorian coast.", "Important urban hub."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/tabou-cities-v2.webp",
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "Tabou is a remote and scenic coastal city in the far southwest of Ivory Coast, located near the border with Liberia. It is the capital of the Tabou Department and is famous for its beautiful, untouched Atlantic beaches and lush palm groves. The city is a major center for the Krou people and has a long history as a maritime trade post. Tabou's economy is based on fishing, palm oil production, and its role as a strategic border town. Its isolation has helped preserve its unique coastal environment and traditional way of life, making it a hidden gem for nature lovers. Geography K7 — western coastal borderlands.",
      de: "Tabou ist die südwestlichste Stadt der Elfenbeinküste, gelegen am Atlantik in der Region San-Pédro, direkt an der Grenze zu Liberia am Cavally-Fluss. Die Stadt war historisch ein wichtiger Hafen für Kru-Seeleute und ein Brennpunkt des Atlantikhandels. Heute lebt Tabou von Hochseefischerei, Holzwirtschaft und Grenzhandel mit Liberia. Die Strände der Region zählen zu den unberührtesten des Landes, und ehemalige Kolonialgebäude prägen das Stadtbild. Tabou ist auch Heimatort vieler bekannter ivorischer Fußballer und ein Symbol der Krou-Kultur. Geschichte K8 – Hafenstädte und Krou-Kultur.",
      hu: "Tabou Elefántcsontpart legdélnyugatibb városa, a San-Pédro régióban, az Atlanti-óceán partján, közvetlenül Libéria határán a Cavally folyó torkolatánál. Történelmileg fontos kikötő volt a kru tengerészek számára és az atlanti kereskedelem gócpontja. Ma Tabou a mélytengeri halászatból, a faiparból és a Libériával folytatott határkereskedelemből él. A régió tengerpartjai az ország legérintetlenebbjei közé tartoznak, és a városképet egykori gyarmati épületek formálják. Tabou számos híres ivory coasti labdarúgó szülővárosa és a krou kultúra szimbóluma. Történelem K8 – kikötővárosok és krou kultúra.",
      ro: "Tabou este cel mai sud-vestic oraș al Coastei de Fildeș, situat pe Oceanul Atlantic în regiunea San-Pédro, chiar la granița cu Liberia, la gura râului Cavally. Istoric, a fost un port important pentru marinarii kru și un punct nodal al comerțului atlantic. Astăzi, Tabou trăiește din pescuitul oceanic, exploatarea forestieră și comerțul transfrontalier cu Liberia. Plajele regiunii sunt printre cele mai neatinse din țară, iar fostele clădiri coloniale dau farmec orașului. Tabou este orașul natal al multor fotbaliști ivorieni renumiți și un simbol al culturii kru. Istorie K8 – orașe portuare și cultura kru."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["Capital of the Tabou Department", "Located in the far Southwest near Liberia", "Major center for the Krou ethnic group", "Famous for beautiful, pristine Atlantic beaches", "Significant hub for palm oil production", "Key border crossing point for regional trade", "Known for its historic maritime trade origins", "Surrounded by dense tropical coastal forests"]
    }
